  "name": "Colonoscopy Prep Workflow",
  "description": "An AI-driven colonoscopy prep workflow that automates patient guidance and operational coordination before endoscopy procedures. The workflow handles inbound prep questions, delivers proactive reminders and prep instructions, supports reschedule/cancel requests, and escalates clinical questions to staff when appropriate.\n\nThe goal is to reduce prep-related call volume, improve patient adherence to prep instructions, decrease same-day cancellations and no-shows, and improve adequate-prep rates through an Epic-integrated, end-to-end patient communication workflow.",
